{
  "$comment": "The tt-pawlegends v1 bridge, one valid and one invalid sample per message type (docs/plans/moba integration plan, section 1). Read by the host parser tests (client/__test__/pawlegends) and the game parser tests (pawlegends/src/embed/__tests__) by relative path; not copied by sync-contracts. `valid` must parse to the same message (unknown fields dropped); `invalid` must be ignored (the parser returns null). `sanitize` cases parse to `expected`: a bad optional field is dropped, the message still counts. Art URLs: the CDN serves cat art from https://tokentails-nfts.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/ (virtual-host style, what `catImg` holds) and the same bucket path-style at https://fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/tokentails-nfts/; both are allowed, nothing else. Sim v9: `champions` carries the shelter champions' cards (the game keeps only the champion catalog ids it knows) and `champion-offer` names one of them.",
